('127.243.d.10.E',4,'A trust is an arrangement in which a trustee:','["signs a lease", "manages property for beneficiaries", "buys insurance", "destroys property"]'::jsonb,1,'Trustees manage assets.','original'),
('127.243.d.10.F',3,'To research real estate cases, a student can use:','["ads", "rumors", "online legal databases", "memes"]'::jsonb,2,'Cases appear online.','original'),
('127.243.d.10.F',4,'A case about an eviction would be most relevant to:','["tax law", "patent law", "insurance law", "landlord-tenant law"]'::jsonb,3,'Eviction involves leases.','original'),
('127.243.d.11.A',3,'Greeting clients politely and listening during a legal office visit show:','["effective interpersonal skills", "rudeness", "poor manners", "distraction"]'::jsonb,0,'Interpersonal skills matter.','original'),
('127.243.d.11.A',4,'During a role-play with an upset client, the best response is to:','["walk away", "listen and acknowledge concerns", "laugh", "interrupt"]'::jsonb,1,'Empathy resolves conflict.','original'),
